        <item>
            <title>1.3.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 18:39:39 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>18</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Overhead 1.3.4.1</h3><ul>
<li>A bell on any aircraft adds it to the alert watchlist, so you can ask to be told when that aeroplane flies over again without opening Settings and typing its registration. It sits on the detail card and on the aircraft's own page in the logbook, and what it saves is the airframe, not the flight number</li>
<li>Aircraft symbols sit properly centred in their circles now, in the sidebar, on the map and in the widgets</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
